147
00:13:55,031 --> 00:13:56,031
They're staying here?

148
00:13:56,031 --> 00:13:59,031
Yes, that's right. They still have lots of luggage left in their room.

149
00:14:00,031 --> 00:14:02,031
I'm sure they'll be back for it sometime.

150
