152
00:14:09,031 --> 00:14:11,031
Look sharp. Leave no stone unturned. Does everybody got it?

153
00:14:12,031 --> 00:14:13,031
Yeah!

154
00:14:13,031 --> 00:14:29,031
No one's here. Are you 100% certain that this is their ship?

155
00:14:30,031 --> 00:14:34,031
There's no mistaking it! Look up there! That's the flag of the Straw Hat Pirates!

156
00:14:35,031 --> 00:14:39,031
They probably already abandoned her. She's all worn out.

157
00:14:44,031 --> 00:14:47,031
Did you find them? No, they're gone.

158
00:14:48,031 --> 00:14:51,031
There's not much left on board. Pretty sure she was abandoned and left to sink.

159
00:14:52,031 --> 00:14:53,031
Let's keep looking around.

160
00:14:53,031 --> 00:15:06,031
Who were those guys?

161
00:15:07,031 --> 00:15:11,031
