192
00:17:03,031 --> 00:17:07,031
I'm sure Luffy's fine. Nami's the one that I'm really worried about right now.

193
00:17:09,031 --> 00:17:12,031
At any rate, this city's becoming quite the ghost town.

194
00:17:13,031 --> 00:17:17,031
The wind's really picking up. I'm sure most people are already in the shelter.

195
00:17:19,031 --> 00:17:20,031
